#==============================================================================
# --- MODIS "XLAI" leaf area index data ---
#
# NOTES:
# (1) LAI data corresponding to each Olson land type is stored in
#      separate netCDF variables (XLAI00, XLAI01, ... XLAI72).
#      The "XLAI" denotes that the files are prepared in this way.
# (2) These files were created from the data in the folder
#      ExtData/CHEM_INPUTS/MODIS_LAI_201707.
# (3) Units are "cm2 leaf/cm2 grid box".
# (4) Data is timestamped on the 15th of each month.
# (5) Do not turn on MODIS_XLAI and Yuan_XLAI at the same time!
#==============================================================================
(((MODIS_XLAI
(((.not.Yuan_XLAI
